Emerging Market Opportunities
Development of High-Absorbance Formulations
Growing demand for advanced nodes is creating opportunities for photoresists with improved EUV photon absorption, sensitivity, and patterning performance. These developments can help manufacturers improve throughput while maintaining resolution.

Metal-Containing and Inorganic Resist Innovation
Metal-containing and inorganic photoresists offer potential advantages in absorption and etch resistance. Continued research into these materials could support new solutions for demanding semiconductor manufacturing applications.

Sustainable Photoresist Chemistry
Environmental and safety requirements are encouraging suppliers to explore lower-toxicity solvents, reduced volatile organic compound emissions, and more sustainable material formulations. Suppliers that combine environmental compliance with reliable lithographic performance may gain a competitive advantage.

